{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55083","headline":"兵要望江南 太乙式第二十七（本门中「太乙」二字，辛本、川本皆作「天乙」○三十一首） 四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 太乙式第二十七（本门中「太乙」二字，辛本、川本皆作「天乙」○三十一首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乙丙丁，名曰是三奇。\n天上若临三吉路，自然神助合天机，任（辛本、川本作「恁」）往莫忧疑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}